     "quote_count": 2,
     "colour": "light_pink",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "parts": [
        "\u201cSaturday morning is the only time I get, so I open the app on the bus and look for the book my daughter wants for school. It says available, so I walk over, and when I get there the shelf is empty and the person at the desk tells me it's in the returns trolley, still to be checked in\u2026",
        "\u2026She found it in the end. But the app said available, and I'd planned my whole morning around that one word, and now I don't really believe it when it says it any more.\u201d"
